# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Public Ramtastic repo — DEFAULT-DENY gitignore
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Nothing is tracked unless it is EXPLICITLY whitelisted below. A Craft
#  solution, a private root, a production-step, a backup — none of it can
#  reach this repo by accident. To publish a file you must add a `!` rule
#  for it here, on purpose. Suspense is the default; disclosure is opt-in.
#
#  Staged like the website: works appear only as they are released.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── 1. Deny everything ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*
/**

# ── 2. Allow the repo plumbing + public root ────────────────────────────
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/lakefile.lean
!/lean-toolchain
!/lake-manifest.json
!/Ramtastic.lean
# Ramtastic.lean is the PUBLIC root — imports only released works.
# Ramtastic_Vega.lean (the full grand-unified root) stays denied by /*.

# ── 3. Allow the Ramtastic/ tree, but deny its contents by default ──────
!/Ramtastic/
/Ramtastic/*

# ── 4. RELEASED: Bass ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
!/Ramtastic/Bass/
/Ramtastic/Bass/*
!/Ramtastic/Bass/HingeRotation.lean
!/Ramtastic/Bass/README.md
# Ramtastic/Bass/README_Vega.md (the full README with cross-work
# "Connectivity" sections) stays denied — it is NOT whitelisted.

# ── Materials (public quote / description) ──────────────────────────────
!/Materials/
/Materials/*
!/Materials/description.png

# ── 5. Belt-and-suspenders: never track these even if a rule slips ──────
# (Craft solutions, private roots, spoiler companions, build artifacts.)
Ramtastic/Craft/
Ramtastic_Vega.lean
**/README_Vega.md
__production_steps/
_backups/
documentation/
.lake/
**/.lake/
*.olean
*.ilean
.DS_Store

# ── TOWER (sectors / scaffolding) — to be whitelisted next, per-file,
#    after each is scanned clean of Craft-solution references. ───────────

